            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "9thVj",
              "x": 220,
              "y": 400,
              "name": "cover",
              "clip": true,
              "width": 1000,
              "height": 500,
              "cornerRadius": "$radius_lg",
              "stroke": {
                "thickness": 1,
                "fill": "$border"
              },
              "effect": {
                "type": "shadow",
                "shadowType": "outer",
                "color": "#0000000D",
                "offset": {
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 20
                },
                "blur": 40
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "QInLW",
              "layoutPosition": "absolute",
              "x": 360,
              "y": 950,
              "name": "articleBody",
              "width": 720,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 32,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "xK0Q1",
                  "fill": "$text_secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Server Components are a new paradigm in React that allows you to render components exclusively on the server. This fundamental shift brings massive performance improvements and a simplified data-fetching mental model.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 20,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "BXCPt",
                  "fill": "$text_primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Why Server Components?",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 32,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "afztJ",
                  "fill": "$text_secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Historically, React was purely a client-side library. As applications grew, developers had to ship increasingly large JavaScript bundles to the browser. Server Components solve this by keeping heavy dependencies on the server.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 20,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "AFR9Y",
                  "name": "quote",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "stroke": {
                    "thickness": {
                      "left": 4
                    },
                    "fill": "$accent"
                  },
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 12,
                  "padding": [
                    0,
                    0,
                    0,
                    24
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "cTxZf",
                      "fill": "$text_primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "\"The beauty of Server Components is that they allow you to write database queries right next to your UI code without ever exposing your secrets to the client.\"",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 24,
